{% comment %}
  Contact page (templates/page.contact.json).

  Hero with a live "open now" status for customer care, three contact channels (phone,
  WhatsApp, email), the Shopify contact form with a topic picker, quick links to the
  policies and the help center, company details and the Afumati showroom.

  All copy has built-in translations for every storefront language (en.default.json is
  at Shopify's key limit), so the page reads the same on every market. The admin page
  body is not rendered: it carried its own global <style> and stale data (Voluntari
  address, Dec 2024 closure).

  Numbers: Romanian storefront shows the landline, every other market the international
  mobile (same rule as the footer). Hours: customer care Mon-Fri 10-18, showroom
  Mon-Fri 9-17, Sat 9-14 (data-hours below, 0 = Sunday, Europe/Bucharest time).

  Name, email, phone and body use Shopify's standard field names so they are refilled
  after a failed submit. The extra fields (topic, order number, market) are named in
  Romanian with Romanian values, so every message reaches the inbox in the same shape.

  Styles: assets/alc-contact.css.
{% endcomment %}
{{ 'alc-contact.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

